  A trailing window is the right shape. A model transcript is the wrong one. Four stacks run at once, and the\
  thing you need to see is whether the run is alive and what it is doing: stage, stack, tool, finding,\
  error. Token deltas from streamText would be a chat UI for work that is not a chat.\
