  Do not tail trace.jsonl as it stands. That file only grows when a stack finishes, the run exits early, or\
  something throws. A model call that is still inside generateText writes nothing, so a live tail of the\
  current log stays blank for the entire stretch where you cannot tell a live run from a dead one.\
